Third-party software and materials

This product may be linked against, built with, or tested using third-party
software. Attribution and license texts for those components are collected in:

  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

When TLS is enabled at build time, the resulting binary is typically linked
against OpenSSL 3.x (Apache License 2.0) or system LibreSSL on OpenBSD. Those
libraries are not redistributed as source from this repository; redistributors
must comply with the license terms of the TLS library they ship or link.

Algorithms and designs implemented in this repository (including SipHash-2-4,
CRC32C Castagnoli, and SwissTable-style open addressing) are independent
implementations. Paper citations and design acknowledgements appear in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the related ADRs. No Abseil, OpenSSL, or LibreSSL
source trees are vendored in this repository.

CI workflows pin third-party GitHub Actions by commit SHA. Those Actions are
not part of the GlyphaStore runtime distribution; their licenses apply to the
Actions themselves when GitHub executes them.
